+# Billing question routing
+
+Billing messages are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`:
+
+- A message containing the case-sensitive substring `refund` routes to `refund-review`.
+- Every other message routes to `invoice-question`.
+
+This classifier only selects a review route. It does not approve refunds, perform invoice actions, or establish a billing outcome.

